ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOn a clear morning, Morning Light waits in the hallway for Dawn. They are both members of the study club, and they plan to attract new members. Star is a new student who just transfers, and he walks down the hallway. Morning Light sees Star, quickly glances at Dawn, and then smiles at Star. Dawn understands the meaning of Morning Light's gaze and nods.\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Dawn do next?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Morning Light and Dawn invite him to join the study club together.\nB. Morning Light leads the new student Star on a campus tour.\nC. Morning Light and Dawn go to meet the new student Star.\nD. Morning Light shows Star the promotional materials of his school.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":5.527683088924603E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0c5d6006945d27fd184","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367685357,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"25de14a8f3344dea8e2bf6653f4d42b4"}